  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Brown the lamb on all sides, about 5 minutes. Remove from heat and set aside.",
    "Add more oil if necessary, then sauté the onion until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tamarind paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Pour in the broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Return the lamb to the pot, cover, and transfer to the oven.",
    "Bake at 300°F for 2 1/2 hours, or until the meat is tender.",
    "Remove the pot from the oven and stir in the yeast and salt.",
    "Let the tagine rest for 10 minutes before serving.",
    "Garnish with parsley and serve with crusty bread.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
